{% comment %}
  Maison Cavallé — close icon

  A cross drawn as an SVG in place of the "×" text glyph, which renders at a
  different weight and optical centre in every font. It inherits the text
  colour; the caller sizes it.

  Accepts:
    class - extra class for the context that sizes the icon
{% endcomment %}
<svg
  class="jci-close{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
>
  <path
    d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.5"
    stroke-linecap="round"
  ></path>
</svg>
